Package: blcfa
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Model Modification in Confirmatory Factor Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lijin", "Zhang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zhanglj37@mail2.sysu.edu.cn"),
    person("Junhao", "Pan", role = "aut"),
    person("Edward", "Ip", role = "aut"))
Description: Uses Bayesian covariance lasso prior confirmatory factor analysis
    to detect significant residual covariances (and cross-loadings) and
    generates and runs the corresponding modified CFA model in 'Mplus'.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
